<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-JC PENNEY UPGRADED, STOCK UP.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-JC PENNEY UPGRADED, STOCK UP.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroders Inc said it upgraded its rating of J.C. Penney Inc to outperform from perform in line at the investment house.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the retailer were up 12/16 to 60-13/16. Earlier, they hit a new year high of 62 a share.</p>
<p>-- The rise came even after Penney's second-quarter profits fell, after factoring in costs for acquiring Eckerd Drugstores.</p>
</text>
